// richtext.kwxts — kwxTypeScript port of wxSamples/src/richtext/richtext.cpp
//
// wxRichTextCtrl sample: a styled-text editor with menu bar, bitmap toolbar,
// two-pane splitter (editor + style list) and a two-pane status bar.
//
// Run from the repository root:
//   bin\Release\kwxts.exe samples\richtext\richtext.kwxts
//
// The C++ extension points (MyRichTextCtrl's locked-content guards, the
// rectangle/composite field types and wxRichTextEnhancedDrawingHandler) are
// installed through the kwxFFI void callbacks, publishing their answers with the
// matching Set*Result functions. The locked runs are tagged with the "Lock"
// property from the PrepareContent hook, exactly as the C++ override does; the
// guards and the drawing handler read it back through
// wxRichTextObject::GetProperties(), which kwxFFI hands out as a borrowed
// reference to the object's own property set.

